flowchart LR
    Intake[Task intake] --> Classify[Risk classification]
    Classify --> Contract[Task contract]
    Contract --> Context[Curated context]
    Context --> Sandbox[Sandboxed agent execution]
    Sandbox --> Diff[Proposed diff]
    Diff --> Evidence[Tests, scans, and evidence]
    Evidence --> Review[Human review]
    Review --> Gates[SDLC gates]
    Gates --> Release{Release?}
    Release -->|Yes| Deploy[Controlled release]
    Release -->|No| Revise[Revise or reject]
    Deploy --> Monitor[Monitor]
    Monitor --> Rollback{Rollback needed?}
    Rollback -->|Yes| Recover[Rollback or disable]
    Rollback -->|No| Done[Done]
    Revise --> Contract

    Secrets[(Secrets)] -. not exposed by default .-> Sandbox
    Policy[Security invariants] --> Contract
    Policy --> Review
    CI[CI/CD] --> Gates
    Audit[Audit trail] --- Contract
    Audit --- Evidence
    Audit --- Review
